{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 660742325466903884,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Add PyBytesWriter C API",
      "source_hash": 10856132336502293659,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "PyBytesWriter C API 추가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958345Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 16873585586045908521,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Add a new ``PyBytesWriter`` C API to create ``bytes`` objects.",
      "source_hash": 7338117707281813471,
      "context_hash": 6087229245203770289,
      "translation": "``bytes`` 객체를 생성하기 위한 새로운 ``PyBytesWriter`` C API를 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Soft deprecate ``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` and ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` APIs.",
      "source_hash": 15251518258265920892,
      "context_hash": 8911885565324792920,
      "translation": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` 및 ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` API를 소프트 폐지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "These APIs treat an immutable ``bytes`` object as a mutable object.",
      "source_hash": 11573638007706828564,
      "context_hash": 15385258589397929837,
      "translation": "이 API들은 불변인 ``bytes`` 객체를 가변 객체로 취급합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "They remain available and maintained, don't emit deprecation warning, but are no longer recommended when writing new code.",
      "source_hash": 16460708483636978069,
      "context_hash": 13104402866709641404,
      "translation": "이 API들은 계속 사용할 수 있고 유지 관리되며 폐지 경고도 내보내지 않지만, 새 코드를 작성할 때는 더 이상 권장되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 3351005285156125815,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Disallow creation of incomplete/inconsistent objects",
      "source_hash": 12286087051888437300,
      "context_hash": 1453928152294788239,
      "translation": "불완전하거나 일관성 없는 객체의 생성 금지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating a Python :class:`bytes` object using ``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` and ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` treats an immutable :class:`bytes` object as mutable.",
      "source_hash": 16472596076120904084,
      "context_hash": 1001338758674281039,
      "translation": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)``\\ 와 ``_PyBytes_Resize()``\\ 를 사용하여 파이썬 :class:`bytes` 객체를 생성하면 불변인 :class:`bytes` 객체를 가변 객체로 취급하게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It goes against the principle that :class:`bytes` objects are immutable.",
      "source_hash": 2189313626659596268,
      "context_hash": 16906727503786439965,
      "translation": "이는 :class:`bytes` 객체가 불변이라는 원칙에 어긋납니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "It also creates an incomplete or \"invalid\" object since bytes are not initialized.",
      "source_hash": 15682272108224024928,
      "context_hash": 12601788637999237479,
      "translation": "또한 바이트가 초기화되지 않으므로 불완전하거나 \"유효하지 않은\" 객체를 만들게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "In Python, a :class:`bytes` object should always have its bytes fully initialized.",
      "source_hash": 10751453724859295760,
      "context_hash": 4032816159743377481,
      "translation": "파이썬에서 :class:`bytes` 객체는 항상 모든 바이트가 초기화되어 있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`Avoid creating incomplete/invalid objects api-evolution#36 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/api-evolution/issues/36>`_",
      "source_hash": 2967195522692377788,
      "context_hash": 15197992468039173479,
      "translation": "`불완전하거나 유효하지 않은 객체의 생성 피하기 api-evolution#36 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/api-evolution/issues/36>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`Disallow mutating immutable objects api-evolution#20 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/api-evolution/issues/20>`_",
      "source_hash": 11073782909335837901,
      "context_hash": 6474908919070695560,
      "translation": "`불변 객체의 변경 금지 api-evolution#20 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/api-evolution/issues/20>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`Disallow creation of incomplete/inconsistent objects problems#56 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/problems/issues/56>`_",
      "source_hash": 2699864496033629810,
      "context_hash": 2399920237744376799,
      "translation": "`불완전하거나 일관성 없는 객체의 생성 금지 problems#56 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/problems/issues/56>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Inefficient allocation strategy",
      "source_hash": 13706580198829400284,
      "context_hash": 5420115358828533735,
      "translation": "비효율적인 할당 전략",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When creating a bytes string and the output size is unknown, one strategy is to allocate a short buffer and extend it (to the exact size) each time a larger write is needed.",
      "source_hash": 9339566921038282588,
      "context_hash": 134725711827899401,
      "translation": "바이트 문자열을 생성할 때 출력 크기를 알 수 없다면, 짧은 버퍼를 할당한 뒤 더 큰 쓰기가 필요할 때마다 버퍼를 (정확한 크기로) 확장하는 전략을 쓸 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This strategy is inefficient because it requires enlarging the buffer multiple times.",
      "source_hash": 9336481691661097482,
      "context_hash": 1167182923765185604,
      "translation": "이 전략은 버퍼를 여러 번 확장해야 하므로 비효율적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It's more efficient to overallocate the buffer the first time that a larger write is needed.",
      "source_hash": 17777520787620034516,
      "context_hash": 8668852162952980284,
      "translation": "더 큰 쓰기가 처음 필요할 때 버퍼를 초과 할당하는 편이 더 효율적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "It reduces the number of expensive ``realloc()`` operations which can imply a memory copy.",
      "source_hash": 18230316730863299312,
      "context_hash": 4773646982346147374,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 메모리 복사를 수반할 수 있는 비용이 큰 ``realloc()`` 연산의 횟수가 줄어듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Specification",
      "source_hash": 12978730460824815227,
      "context_hash": 2082385416101130284,
      "translation": "명세",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "API",
      "source_hash": 17306549135961116108,
      "context_hash": 10498895183092679707,
      "translation": "API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Create, Finish, Discard",
      "source_hash": 14064353138398968519,
      "context_hash": 13399893865423973019,
      "translation": "생성, 완료, 폐기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
