      "source_hash": 9106025444018641399,
      "context_hash": 3782510109884599996,
      "translation": "게터",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Low-level API",
      "source_hash": 3749513689328146948,
      "context_hash": 18269759870513551136,
      "translation": "저수준 API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Overallocation",
      "source_hash": 9698310581143928277,
      "context_hash": 11859588734975778953,
      "translation": "초과 할당",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": ":c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Resize` and :c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Grow` overallocate the internal buffer to reduce the number of ``realloc()`` calls and so reduce memory copies.",
      "source_hash": 12897700542625238270,
      "context_hash": 9564286189613928714,
      "translation": ":c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Resize`\\ 와 :c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Grow`\\ 는 ``realloc()`` 호출 횟수를 줄여 메모리 복사를 줄이기 위해 내부 버퍼를 초과 할당합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": ":c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Finish` trims overallocations: it shrinks the internal buffer to the exact size when creating the final :class:`bytes` object.",
      "source_hash": 3762512194776888744,
      "context_hash": 4933556468566768470,
      "translation": ":c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Finish`\\ 는 초과 할당분을 잘라냅니다. 즉, 최종 :class:`bytes` 객체를 생성할 때 내부 버퍼를 정확한 크기로 줄입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Thread safety",
      "source_hash": 17176637265833871168,
      "context_hash": 14658446169314726903,
      "translation": "스레드 안전성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The API is not thread safe: a writer should only be used by a single thread at the same time.",
      "source_hash": 14026375721000240312,
      "context_hash": 694609680665894667,
      "translation": "이 API는 스레드 안전하지 않습니다. 하나의 writer는 한 번에 하나의 스레드에서만 사용해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Soft deprecations",
      "source_hash": 12045959750079737344,
      "context_hash": 12885570497551205132,
      "translation": "소프트 폐지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:04:31.958348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Soft deprecate ``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` and ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` APIs.",
      "source_hash": 15251518258265920892,
      "context_hash": 10537300955184488093,
      "translation": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` 및 ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` API를 소프트 폐지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699545Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These APIs treat an immutable ``bytes`` object as a mutable object.",
      "source_hash": 11573638007706828564,
      "context_hash": 15385258589397929837,
      "translation": "이 API들은 불변 ``bytes`` 객체를 가변 객체처럼 취급합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "They remain available and maintained, don't emit deprecation warning, but are no longer recommended when writing new code.",
      "source_hash": 16460708483636978069,
      "context_hash": 8364046745918313858,
      "translation": "이 API들은 계속 사용할 수 있고 유지 관리되며 폐지 경고도 발생시키지 않지만, 새 코드를 작성할 때는 더 이상 권장되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(str, size)`` is not soft deprecated.",
      "source_hash": 8829139633324805782,
      "context_hash": 18199453140876361947,
      "translation": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(str, size)``\\ 는 소프트 폐지되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699546Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Only calls with ``NULL`` *str* are soft deprecated.",
      "source_hash": 11012038664516132257,
      "context_hash": 17532139793204577505,
      "translation": "*str*\\ 이 ``NULL``\\ 인 호출만 소프트 폐지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699547Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
