    {
      "id": "section:16/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Reference Implementation",
      "source_hash": 9294161050860502574,
      "context_hash": 9450391197303347573,
      "translation": "참조 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "reference implementation": "참조 구현"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699549Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`Pull request gh-131681 <https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/131681>`__.",
      "source_hash": 2035776049468835709,
      "context_hash": 9582606525723416956,
      "translation": "`풀 리퀘스트 gh-131681 <https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/131681>`__.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699549Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Notes on the CPython reference implementation which are not part of the Specification:",
      "source_hash": 6614931690360180417,
      "context_hash": 5896473003248773853,
      "translation": "명세에 포함되지 않는 CPython 참조 구현에 관한 참고 사항입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "reference implementation": "참조 구현"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699549Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The implementation allocates internally a :class:`bytes` object, so :c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Finish` just returns the object without having to copy memory.",
      "source_hash": 10132615189383840205,
      "context_hash": 1025095404504387722,
      "translation": "구현은 내부적으로 :class:`bytes` 객체를 할당하므로, :c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Finish`\\ 는 메모리를 복사할 필요 없이 그 객체를 그대로 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "For strings up to 256 bytes, a small internal raw buffer of bytes is used.",
      "source_hash": 8836914740553247910,
      "context_hash": 834719036731354098,
      "translation": "256바이트 이하의 문자열에는 작은 내부 원시 바이트 버퍼를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "It avoids having to resize a :class:`bytes` object which is inefficient.",
      "source_hash": 1542680394624276735,
      "context_hash": 13663971381205434123,
      "translation": "이를 통해 비효율적인 :class:`bytes` 객체 크기 조정을 피할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "At the end, :c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Finish` creates the :class:`bytes` object from this small buffer.",
      "source_hash": 11798069910057644200,
      "context_hash": 12249661489118654214,
      "translation": "마지막에 :c:func:`PyBytesWriter_Finish`\\ 가 이 작은 버퍼로부터 :class:`bytes` 객체를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "A free list is used to reduce the cost of allocating a :c:type:`PyBytesWriter` on the heap memory.",
      "source_hash": 8065820404591136585,
      "context_hash": 16171616527047134230,
      "translation": "힙 메모리에 :c:type:`PyBytesWriter`\\ 를 할당하는 비용을 줄이기 위해 프리 리스트를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Backwards Compatibility",
      "source_hash": 10657204087101124989,
      "context_hash": 12052023468500661121,
      "translation": "하위 호환성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There is no impact on the backward compatibility, only new APIs are added.",
      "source_hash": 9770235532879289832,
      "context_hash": 12498608131162801643,
      "translation": "새로운 API만 추가되므로 하위 호환성에는 영향이 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "backward compatibility": "하위 호환성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` and ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` APIs are soft deprecated.",
      "source_hash": 7473756190592484621,
      "context_hash": 6200756036302192419,
      "translation": "``PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` 및 ``_PyBytes_Resize()`` API는 소프트 폐지됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699551Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "No new warnings is emitted when these functions are used and they are not planned for removal.",
      "source_hash": 2555676802552903780,
      "context_hash": 14731778503087059496,
      "translation": "이 함수들을 사용해도 새로운 경고가 발생하지 않으며, 제거할 계획도 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:38:59.699551Z",
      "issues": []
    },
